heCapacity));","+      }","+      if (alias != null) {","+        aliasCacheTotals.merge(alias, new CacheTotals(cacheUsed, cacheCapacity), CacheTotals::plus);","+      }","+    });","+","+    aliasCacheTotals.forEach((alias, totals) -> {","+      if (totals.capacity() > 0) {","+        stats.add(","+            Stats.Tier.ALIAS_CACHE_UTILIZATION,","+            RowKey.of(Dimension.TIER_ALIAS, alias),","+            toPercent(totals.used(), totals.capacity())","+        );","+      }","     });","   }"," ","+  private record CacheTotals(long used, long capacity)","+  {","+    CacheTotals plus(CacheTotals other)","+    {","+      return new CacheTotals(used + other.used, capacity + other.capacity);","+    }","+  }","+","+  private static long toPercent(long used, long capacity)","+  {","+    return Math.round(100.0 * used / capacity);","+  }","+","   private void collectUsedSegmentStats(DruidCoordinatorRuntimeParams params, CoordinatorRunStats stats)","   {","     for (final ImmutableDruidDataSource dataSource : params.getDataSourcesSnapshot().getDataSourcesWithAllUsedSegments()) {"],"additions":31,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"server/src/main/java/org/apache/druid/server/coordinator/stats/Stats.java","lines":["@@ -154,6 +154,17 @@ public static class Tier","      */","     public static final CoordinatorStat CACHE_USED","         = CoordinatorStat.toDebugAndEmit(\"cacheUsed\", \"tier/segmentCache/used\");","+    /**","+     * {@link #CACHE_USED} as a whole-number percentage of {@link #CACHE_CAPACITY}.","+     */","+    public static final CoordinatorStat CACHE_UTILIZATION","+        = CoordinatorStat.toDebugAndEmit(\"cacheUtil\", \"tier/segmentCache/utilization\");","+    /**","+     * Segment cache utilization of all tiers under a tier alias, as a whole-number percentage of their combined","+     * capacity.","+     */","+    public static final CoordinatorStat ALIAS_CACHE_UTILIZATION","+        = CoordinatorStat.toDebugAndEmit(\"aliasCacheUtil\", \"tier